            "review_title": "Review at Nhà Hàng Hoà Nhân Ân",
            "review_text": "JSTrip_77\nSarajevo, Bosnia and Herzegovina1194 contributions\n0\nFantastic Family Restaurant Off the Tourist Circuit\nDec 2020\nIf you're looking for a delicious spot for fresh seafood in a local environment, this is the BEST we found. This is a wonderful restaurant run by a sweet family. We played ball with their young son while we waited for our food and when our food came, boy were we impressed. The almond breaded shrimp is their signature dish and it was awesome. It also helped to set it apart from all of the other restaurants with pretty much identical menus. But, their seafood noodle (my xoa hai san) was also really good! You really cannot go wrong here. And, speaking frankly, it was also the cleanest of all of the local seafood restaurants we ate in.\n\nThere is apparently another restaurant with the same name - and quite nearby - that serves Chinese food/dim sum. This is not the same place.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten December 29, 2020",
